==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2.67~13.33 seconds<sup>80f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 4~20 seconds<sup>120f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. Li'l Gau has such a pathetic range that even a simple [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] can outrange it.

